<Document id="1X4jqA8P2cPY2iM80qGdWAdo6B9QLzpZO">
	<name>Dm2727’s Philippine Siren Map - Ver. 3.11.0</name>
	<description>5 smol ms siregs and 3 pnr crossings done

Newly added: 
5x MS-190
Whelen-sized PA speaker
YASONG SLA-01H
6x Qlight SHD2-H
4x E2S A121AX

Removed: none

Number of sirens on map: 1166

Number of sirens added: 17

https://www.youtube.com/@realDm2727

©Dm2727 2025-2026</description>
